# Freedom with Friends — ACNH 2.0.6 shared-owner / visitor permissions
# Build ID: 15765149DF53BA41
#
# GOAL (Dodo / local-play / Hamachi visit): every client treats the local player
# as island owner/resident for:
#   - Nook Stop / Miles redemption
#   - Tom Nook / Isabelle island-edit menus
#   - terraforming / place / dig while visiting
#   - mailbox against the HOST island
#
# NOT POSSIBLE via exefs alone:
#   - spawning a real visitor tent/house plot on the host save
#     (houses = resident slots on that save, max 8 players)
#
# STATUS: STUB — do not enable guessed offsets (crash / desync / save risk).
# Rename off .disabled only after real 2.0.6 ARM offsets are filled.
# EVERY multiplayer client must use the same patch set + same game version.

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

# @enabled Force IsIslandOwner / resident true while visiting
# <offset> mov w0, #1
# <offset> ret

# @enabled Allow Nook Stop / Miles machine as visitor
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Allow Tom Nook / Isabelle full resident menus as visitor
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Allow mailbox open / villager mail on host island
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Allow host terraform / place while visitors present
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Allow visitor terraform / place / dig
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Relax best-friend tool locks
# <offset> nop
